Collection ADTs represent dif ways of organicing and managing groups of elements, each governed by specific rules on how its stored, accessed, inserted, and removed.
Ex:
stack : LIFO
Queue : FIFO
Deque: allows at both ends
List : maintains sequence and positional access
Set: does not allow duplicate elements
Priority Queue: removes elements according to priority
Map ; stores key-value pairs, with each key being unipue